  (descr "Stacking header for the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-3.49: its two 1x11 2.54 mm rows (A = Waveshare J6, B = Waveshare J3), 26.491 mm apart (from Waveshare's STEP model). User.Drawings: the 3.49's outline and its holes (4x 2.72 mm corner holes for M2.5, 2.5 mm from its edges; 2x 1.6 mm on the centreline; 1x 2.4 mm), to line up standoffs. As seen from above with the 3.49 screen side up: the power board's top faces the 3.49's flat battery side, where the header pins come out.")
